arbeitnow:ai-solutions-engineer-all-gend:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;You will join STARK’s Internal AI &amp;amp; Infrastructure team. Rather than building theoretical tools, we embed into cross-functional teams across Engineering, Operations, Finance, and Corporate functions to ship secure, production-ready AI workflows that streamline operations and empower teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;As an AI Solutions Engineer, you will bridge the gap between frontier AI capabilities and operational workflows. You will partner with teams—from hardware engineering to C-level executives—to structure processes, rapidly build reliable AI solutions, and upskill colleagues through documentation and coaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to identify high-leverage use cases and translate loose requirements into structured workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Prioritize high-ROI automations and rapidly ship working v0.1 prototypes to users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Build production-ready AI solutions (agentic workflows, custom skills, MCP connectors, LLM tools) using Gemini Enterprise, Python, and APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Establish evaluation standards, test harnesses, and clean data pipelines to ensure tool reliability and usability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Ensure enterprise-grade security, defence data privacy compliance, robust database persistence, and documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Coach and upskill colleagues through pair-building, workshops, and Show &amp;amp; Tell sessions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Stay ahead of AI developments, evaluate new models, and represent STARK in local AI communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Degree in CS, Software Engineering, Information Systems, or equivalent practical experience with software architecture, databases, APIs, and Python/TypeScript.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;1–2+ years of hands-on experience with modern AI technologies: agentic workflows, MCP connectors, LLM APIs, prompt engineering, and evals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Executive presence and ability to work autonomously with stakeholders from shop-floor technicians to C-level leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Strong communication skills with a passion for teaching and enabling others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Solid engineering discipline regarding data hygiene, compliance, documentation, and maintainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Willingness to travel ~1x/month between Munich, Berlin, and international STARK sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Fluency in English (written and spoken) is mandatory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Experience as Forward Deployed Engineer, Solutions Engineer, Technical Consultant, or Freelance Builder.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Experience with Google Cloud / Gemini Enterprise or deploying on-premise open-weight models in secure environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;Fluency in German, making it even easier to run local workshops across our Munich and Berlin offices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"&gt;If you're interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We're looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:security-engineer-london-24775:
&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href="wppmedia.com"&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About DTA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DTA is WPP’s global data products and technology company. We bring together technology, data and analytics to help agencies and clients transform the value of data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform, Open Media Studio, is an AI-enabled media and data platform built for the next era of advertising. Our 1,000-plus team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem-solvers works across 20 markets worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Security Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help design, build and operate secure cloud platforms, data pipelines and data-sharing solutions. These capabilities support our internal product teams and deliver data to clients—either in client-owned cloud environments or in our own.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is GCP-first, with security patterns that can be applied across AWS and Azure. You’ll help embed security into infrastructure, identities, data products and AI-enabled services from the start—not bolt it on later.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI agents connect to data and systems through technologies such as the Model Context Protocol (MCP), our security model needs to account for machine identities, tool permissions and automated actions. You’ll help build the controls that make these services safe to use, including authentication, authorisation, monitoring and protection against risks such as prompt injection, tool misuse and data leakage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Platform Engineering, Data Engineering, Security Operations, Privacy, Legal, Marketing and Client Delivery teams. The goal is to make the secure approach the easiest approach—and to deliver reliable, well-governed data to our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Secure cloud platforms and automation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve secure cloud foundations in GCP, including resource hierarchies, organisation policies, VPC Service Controls, private connectivity, customer-managed encryption keys (CMEK) and centralised logging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable Terraform modules and project factories so teams can provision, test and redeploy secure environments consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply policy-as-code in CI/CD, use keyless pipelines through workload identity federation, and automate detection and remediation of configuration drift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish equivalent security patterns in AWS and Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Protect AI agents and MCP services&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design and evolve secure patterns for MCP hosts, clients, servers, gateways and registries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build or operate MCP gateways and registries with approved-tool allowlisting, tool-level authorisation, rate limits and auditable records of tool calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement OAuth 2.1/OIDC authorisation using short-lived, scoped and audience-bound tokens; avoid token passthrough and require human approval for high-impact actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help secure MCP services hosted on Cloud Run or GKE, using controls such as Identity-Aware Proxy and prompt or response screening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Threat-model and help defend against prompt injection, tool poisoning, unauthorised tool changes, confused-deputy attacks and data exfiltration through chained tool calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help secure the agent and connector supply chain through vetting, signing, versioning, scanning and sandboxing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Engineer identity and access controls&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement identity patterns for people, workloads and agents across Microsoft Entra ID and Okta, including federation, SSO, SCIM, Conditional Access and phishing-resistant MFA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend identity governance to service accounts, API keys, workload identities and AI agents, using Saviynt or a comparable identity governance platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support clear ownership, lifecycle management and regular access reviews for non-human identities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply zero-standing-privilege principles through just-in-time elevation, short-lived credentials and automated access revocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess emerging capabilities such as Microsoft Entra Agent ID and Okta Cross App Access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Protect data and enable secure sharing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build data transformation pipelines and governed data products using dbt, SQL and Terraform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply controls such as data classification, lineage, model contracts, policy tags, masking, row-level security and least-privilege access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver data securely to clients and partners through BigQuery Analytics Hub, cross-cloud storage transfers and API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support secure ingestion, cleansing, enrichment and transformation, with scoped access, encryption, audit logging and monitoring at each hand-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop secure data-sharing patterns, including data clean rooms and consent-aware pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help prevent sensitive data from leaking into agent prompts, context windows, logs or third-party models, and ensure agents access curated data rather than unrestricted raw tables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Secure social and marketing platforms&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring brand social accounts, advertising platforms and martech tools under central identity control using Cerby or a comparable solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support secure onboarding and offboarding, credential rotation, enforced MFA and time-limited, auditable access for agencies, freelancers and creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat social content—including comments, direct messages, reviews and mentions—as untrusted input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design guardrails so agents cannot combine access to private data, untrusted content and the ability to publish externally without appropriate safeguards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing and Communications teams to detect and respond to account takeovers, impersonation and advertising-account fraud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Improve detection, response and secure delivery&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Send cloud, identity, MCP, model-safety and social-platform logs to the SIEM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build detections as code and develop SOAR playbooks that can revoke tokens, disable agents, quarantine MCP servers and rotate credentials, with human approval for high-impact actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create golden paths, reference implementations and runbooks that help delivery teams build securely and independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to threat-modelling sessions, red-team exercises, design reviews and audit-readiness activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help map controls to relevant standards and automate evidence collection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and mentor less experienced engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Experience and technical skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seasoned&lt;strong&gt; experience&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud infrastructure, platform, data or security engineering, including &lt;strong&gt;hands-on GCP experience in production&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical GCP skills, such as IAM, organisation policies, networking, VPC Service Controls, Cloud Run or GKE, and BigQuery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of comparable security capabilities in AWS and Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Terraform experience, including reusable modules, environment and state management, testing, CI/CD and policy-as-code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience engineering identity controls with Microsoft Entra ID and/or Okta, including SSO, SCIM, Conditional Access, MFA and privileged or just-in-time access. Familiarity with Saviynt or another IGA platform is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on SIEM and SOAR experience, including onboarding log sources, developing detections and building response playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical understanding of MCP and agent security. This could come from production work, open-source contributions or well-developed proofs of concept.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with dbt and SQL for data transformation or data products, and a working understanding of data-layer controls such as classification, masking, row-level security and access grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering data to clients or partners across organisational or cloud boundaries, using services such as BigQuery Analytics Hub, GCS, S3, Azure Blob Storage or APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding ability in Python, Go or TypeScript for automation, tooling or MCP server development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with social, advertising or marketing platforms and the security challenges involved in managing brand accounts and non-SSO applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How you work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build securely by default and consider how systems could be misused from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You automate repeatable work, test what you codify and look for ways to make secure delivery easier.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance risk, usability and delivery needs, and can explain when a solution is not ready—and what would make it safe to proceed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly with technical and non-technical colleagues and can explain security risks in plain language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You document decisions and create practical standards, golden paths and runbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You measure outcomes, learn from incidents and feedback, and improve controls over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate inclusively, seek different perspectives and support the development of colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Security and regulatory frameworks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be familiar with relevant security, privacy and AI frameworks, such as ISO 27001, SOC 2, NIST CSF 2.0, NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001, CIS Benchmarks, UK GDPR/GDPR and the EU AI Act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Certifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You should hold—or be willing to achieve after joining:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Professional Cloud Architect&lt;/strong&gt; within six months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Professional Cloud Security Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; within 12 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP will fund exam fees and provide dedicated study time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating MCP servers or gateways in production, or contributing to open-source agent or security tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Security Operations or Microsoft Sentinel experience, particularly detection-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes or service-mesh security experience, including workload identity, policy controllers or mTLS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software supply-chain security experience, such as SLSA, Sigstore/cosign, SBOMs or Binary Authorization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Privacy engineering or AI assurance experience, including data clean rooms, consent management, pseudonymisation or AI red-teaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MITRE ATLAS, OWASP GenAI guidance or AI security testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agency, media or consumer-brand experience, particularly in environments requiring multi-client data segregation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further relevant certifications, such as Google Professional Security Operations Engineer, Google Professional Cloud DevOps Engineer, HashiCorp Terraform Associate, Microsoft SC-300/AZ-500, Okta Certified Professional, AWS Certified Security – Specialty or CCSP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Life at WPP Media&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work is powered by a commitment to &lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;: investing in our people and supporting transformational creativity. We &lt;strong&gt;Lead Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;, champion growth and development, and create opportunities for colleagues to build connections and learn across WPP Media and WPP’s global network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create an open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and can progress. Employee resource groups, in-office events and opportunities to share ideas help bring our teams together. WPP Media also offers a comprehensive benefits package; specific benefits vary by location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer. We consider applicants without discrimination and are committed to an inclusive workplace. Teams typically work in the office around four days a week to support collaboration and connection. If you need an accommodation or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a UK-based role. Applicants must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
